    core_synastry: `When one chart's Neptune meets another's Sun at trine, the Neptune-bearer's imaginative register and the Sun-bearer's identity find each other in the same elemental family, moving in compatible directions without effort. The Neptune-bearer's softening reads as warmth and depth to the Sun-bearer rather than as dissolution; the Sun-bearer's identity reads as worth imaginatively engaging rather than as too defined to be interesting. The bond produces a baseline of genuine atmospheric warmth without manufactured intensity.`,
    behavioral_synastry: `The Neptune-bearer's imaginative attention arrives at the Sun-bearer's life as the kind of vision the Sun-bearer welcomes rather than feels destabilized by. The Sun-bearer's directional drive arrives at the Neptune-bearer's awareness as the kind of concrete reality the Neptune-bearer's imagination can flourish alongside. This produces a connection where vision and identity reinforce each other naturally.`,
    friendship_synastry: `In a friendship, this trine produces the friend whose imaginative perspective enriches the Sun-bearer's life without making the friendship feel ungrounded. The Neptune-bearer brings vision; the Sun-bearer brings the steady identity that integrates it; both friends often report that the friendship has a quality of dreamlike warmth other friendships do not.`,
