    core_transit: `Transiting Neptune forms a trine to your natal Sun, activating an extended period—potentially many years—where spiritual sensitivity and conscious purpose are drawing from the same elemental source. The hundred-twenty-degree geometry means the Sun's clarity and Neptune's access to the transcendent recognize each other as compatible. This is Neptune enhancing the Sun's capacity for meaning rather than dissolving the Sun's capacity for purpose.`,
